Viktor 14.10.2026: «IP Студии и Лаба мы же раньше уже ограничивали локалхостом и масками локальных сетей… юзеры без файрвола... или на публичном вайфае - это проблема. Может в Engine настройки блок по безопасности IP сетки добавить? И напоминалку попапом для свежих инсталляций. С минигайдом там же, и чекбокс "Моё решение осознанное"».

- tools/yue-server.cpp: Access {local | private | list, nets, acknowledged} in user/access.json beside settings.json (RUACH_ACCESS elsewhere), read again when it changes; the gate answers loopback always, private networks as 1114, or the networks listed (CIDR, IPv4 and IPv6 through inet_pton); GET /access (the decision and the asker), POST /access (validated, acknowledged stamped, 409 lockout for a choice that would shut out the asker unless lockout:true). RUACH_ALLOW_PUBLIC=1 still opens it to anyone.
- console: Engine → Security (three choices, the networks, «+ the asker's /24», Keep it), a row of its own under Updates; the first start's question with a mini guide and «My decision is a conscious one», before the machine's scan, never in a test browser; i18n in the eleven languages.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
